/E (Case1: Artificial Intelligence in Recruitment. A corporation employs an automated screening instrument that selects candidates for consideration. The model omits women from technical positions due to historical data that embodies prior biases, in the absence of oversight. AI possessing a soul necessitates bias assessments, varied training datasets, and transparent standards. and human evaluation. The organization additionally instructs recruiters to analyze recommendations rigorously and to record overrides. The Candidates must possess recourse: a means to challenge judgments and comprehend evaluation standards.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
