/P 79 0 R
/E (The answer is affirmative specifically since education and culture need time, and companion designs can serve as supportive frameworks. AlmIA is not intended to substitute moral education with the aim of reinforcing it during instances when automated systems may otherwise promote haste and inactivity. It seeks to safeguard the human "pause":  the period of contemplation where freedom and responsibility coexist. In conclusion, AI with a soul is not a mere luxury. The fundamental prerequisite for sustainable innovation, social trust, and a future in which technology enhances rather than undermines human existence.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
