340 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The author affirms a strong commitment to academic integrity, human dignity, and the ethical reflection in the development, deployment, and use of Artificial Intelligence. This paper is intended solely for educational, scholarly, and constructive purposes, with the objective of promoting responsible innovation that benefits individuals, organiza-tions, and society. It emphasizes the importance of ensuring that AI technologies are designed and applied in ways that uphold fairness, transparency, accountability, and respect for fundamental human values. By encouraging ethical awareness and interdisciplinary dialogue, the paper seeks to contribute to the development of AI systems that support human well-being, foster trust, and advance sustainable and socially responsible technological progress.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
