/Title (From this perspective, AI is not. It serves solely as an instrument for task execution; it reflects and imparts knowledge. It can enhance learning or supplant it; it can foster a positive disposition or exacerbate pessimism; it can stimulate The soul \(representing meaning and conscience\) can either be stimulated or dulled; it can incite actions that yield positive outcomes or those that end in harm. The design and governance of AI dictate which the way becomes predominant.)
